    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle Bones Magic is an idler incremental game you play as a necromancer raising the dead and snowballing them into enormous hosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447030/extras/6efbabb2399d797cf062bfd7d3df5ce8.poster.avif?t=1753821279\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447030/extras/6efbabb2399d797cf062bfd7d3df5ce8.apng?t=1753821279\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=120 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go from a lowly initiate in the dark arts  to a powerful necromancer taking over the world with hordes of countless zombies. You'll manage your resources to raise  all sorts of creatures, which you'll put to work gathering more resources and attacking your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447030/extras/30be03e73dad3700dd7ebfc261370497.poster.avif?t=1753821279\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447030/extras/30be03e73dad3700dd7ebfc261370497.webp?t=1753821279\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=90 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from animating bones  into skeletal servants. Use them to pick up more bones to make more of themselves, then start exploring, expanding, and exploiting your surroundings. Shortly you'll be amassing thousands of zombies and taking over entire countries, learning how to create even more powerful creatures and indoctrinating more necromancers into your cult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447030/extras/ab3128d3219e18d5b5bff3b3f55e09c3.poster.avif?t=1753821279\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447030/extras/ab3128d3219e18d5b5bff3b3f55e09c3.webm?t=1753821279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash a zombie apocalypse on this unsuspecting world and watch your hordes multiply and take over everything.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle Bones Magic is an idler incremental game you play as a necromancer raising the dead and snowballing them into enormous hosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447030/extras/6efbabb2399d797cf062bfd7d3df5ce8.poster.avif?t=1753821279\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447030/extras/6efbabb2399d797cf062bfd7d3df5ce8.apng?t=1753821279\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=120 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go from a lowly initiate in the dark arts  to a powerful necromancer taking over the world with hordes of countless zombies. You'll manage your resources to raise  all sorts of creatures, which you'll put to work gathering more resources and attacking your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447030/extras/30be03e73dad3700dd7ebfc261370497.poster.avif?t=1753821279\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447030/extras/30be03e73dad3700dd7ebfc261370497.webp?t=1753821279\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=90 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from animating bones  into skeletal servants. Use them to pick up more bones to make more of themselves, then start exploring, expanding, and exploiting your surroundings. Shortly you'll be amassing thousands of zombies and taking over entire countries, learning how to create even more powerful creatures and indoctrinating more necromancers into your cult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447030/extras/ab3128d3219e18d5b5bff3b3f55e09c3.poster.avif?t=1753821279\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447030/extras/ab3128d3219e18d5b5bff3b3f55e09c3.webm?t=1753821279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash a zombie apocalypse on this unsuspecting world and watch your hordes multiply and take over everything.</p>",
